Z||000005||Shaun41178||10-21-1999||03:22 PM||||So what were your dyno numbers?<P>I would love to go on the power tour but I am stuck here in between the east and the west.  The west ends in Mi and the east runs all down the east coast.  I am stuck here in NW Ohio so the only one I could really hit would be the final leg into michigan.  Sure I could join out in illinois but I find it pointless to double back on myself.  ||||reg||1
