Z||000008||batboy||10-22-1999||12:19 AM||||Phil! Those are impressive numbers for a 3800 V6. That's small block Chevy V8 dyno numbers in some cars. Bet it surprised some of those Hot Rod gear heads there!||||reg||1
Z||000009||Phil||10-22-1999||08:33 AM||||There was a fella there with a Northstar in a non-Fiero and he was a little dissapointed when he only got 19 more HP than me but I had him by 10 ft. lb. torque. Like the guys running the dyno said torque moves cars down the strip HP moves them off the sales floor||||reg||1
